Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavy midnight rain pounds relentlessly upon the ancient and forgotten stone temple rooftop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.86,0:00:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadowy figures emerge silently from the swirling mist with glowing red assassin blades.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.71,0:00:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Kaito stands motionless against the dark storm while facing his deadly pursuers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.52,0:00:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,His piercing eyes focus sharply upon the chaotic drops falling from the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.66,0:00:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ancient mystical energy surges rapidly through his fingertips into the wet night air.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.03,0:00:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Falling raindrops instantly freeze solid midair creating an impossible wall of glistening ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.34,0:00:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Shocked dark assassins freeze in utter disbelief at the incredible display of mastery.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.15,0:00:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaito sweeps his blade forward shattering the frozen water into deadly crystal shards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.77,0:00:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The defeated shadow enemies dissolve into harmless black smoke beneath the stormy sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.46,0:00:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence returns completely to the sacred grounds as the midnight storm finally clears away.
